        {
          "cell": "A2",
          "value": "Client convention: face quote annualized; step-ups at months 13/25/...; no face rent during free months; gross expense deduction annual_expenses_psf/12 every month (NNN = 0); TI subtracted once; net total / term_months x 12. Undiscounted rent-only, not an appraisal.",
